Package: languageserver
Title: Dependency-Free Language Server for R
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(person("Randy", "Lai", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "randy.cs.lai@gmail.com"),
    person("Kun", "Ren", role = "ctb", email = "mail@renkun.me"))
Description: A minimal implementation of the Language Server Protocol for R
    using only base R and a small amount of portable C. Provides diagnostics,
    completion, hover, signature help, definitions, references, highlights,
    rename, document and workspace symbols, and folding ranges.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/REditorSupport/languageserver/
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: tools, utils
NeedsCompilation: yes
Encoding: UTF-8
